  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Hi VRChat Team,\n\nI’m writing because the current 10 MB upload limit has become really difficult to work with. Even small avatars and worlds often go past that size now, and it’s honestly discouraging to keep running into that limit over and over. It feels like creativity gets cut down before it even has a chance to grow.\n\nIt would mean so much if you could consider raising the limit to 50 MB or even higher. A change like that would make a huge difference for creators who just want to share their work without stripping away everything that makes it special. Right now it’s hard not to feel a little defeated.\n\nI appreciate all the work you put into the platform, and I hope this is something you might look into. It would genuinely help a lot of us.\n\nThank you for taking the time to read this.",
